# APL: ISO/IEC 13751 (Extended APL) and the Dyalog APL Language Reference; requirements/languages/apl.md
name     apl dyalog
keyword  :If :Else :ElseIf :EndIf :For :In :EndFor :While :EndWhile :Repeat :Until :Return :Namespace
keyword  :EndNamespace :Class :EndClass
line-comment   ⍝
string   ' '  : doubled
string   " "
operators  +-*/<>=,.:;()[]{}
